  "details": "# Issue:\n\nIf you turn on Fallback Shaders for your own Avatar you will look fine in your normal view, but your Mirror Clone will appear really shiny / reflective.\n\nThis only affects your own Avatar locally.\n\n**Additional Info:**\n\nI've not been able to determine what exactly causes this, as not every Avatar is affected.\n\nHere is a link to an Avatar that is affected:\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_a2eaa34b-38d3-4c17-8a86-5cf0f28a8d5b\n\n# Expected Behaviour:\n\nThe Fallback Shaders of the Mirror Clone should look exactly the same as they do in your normal view.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nThe first picture shows the normal view of my Avatar with Fallback Shaders enabled and the second one shows the mirror / camera:",
